WEBVTT

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:03.630
<i>On my first day working at 
the Mawarimichi Cafe...</i>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:07.940
<b>Boom</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:07.940
<b>Effectively a tutor</b>

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.550
<i>Somehow, I've ended up being a tutor.</i>

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:12.430
I'm so sorry to have you doing 
this on your very first day.

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:14.140
It's fine.

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:17.320
Do you need a hint?

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:18.610
Nope.

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:20.830
<i>He doesn't like to lose.</i>

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.490
<i>His focus is pretty good once he gets going,</i>

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.250
<i>so I'll just leave him be for now.</i>

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:29.590
<i>That said, I can't just wait around...</i>

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:31.270
Um...

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:32.150
Huh?

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:35.110
If there's anything I can 
do, please let me know.

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:36.830
Oh, thank you!

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:40.640
<b>Meet</b>

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:45.610
<i>Uhh, this is... Sou... Souma-kun.</i>

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:48.950
<i>People with flashy hair make me nervous.</i>

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:50.930
<i>I'll need to make sure not 
to cause him any trouble.</i>

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:52.770
Excuse me.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:52.740
<b>Move</b>

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:56.500
Excuse me.

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:56.700
<b>Move</b>

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:32.000
<b>#08
Detour</b>

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:30.290
<b>Move</b>

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:31.380
<b>Move</b>

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:32.670
<b>Move</b>

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:35.270
Sorry about that.

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:37.540
<i>I bungled that.</i>

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:39.710
<i>I hope he's not mad.</i>

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:42.390
<b>Huh</b>

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:43.300
<b>Shiver   Shiver</b>

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:44.990
<i>He's shaking with rage!</i>

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.220
<b>Shiver   Shiver</b>

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.930
Now I've done it.

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:47.610
<i>Now I've done it.</i>

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:51.140
<i>Upon closer inspection, he's got 
piercings and tattoos, too.</i>

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:53.140
<i>So maybe he's just got 
a really innocent face,</i>

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:55.780
<i>but is actually really wild.</i>

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:59.110
The type he's never
 been around...

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:57.480
For real, newbie.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.110
<b>* Hayate's Mental Image</b>

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.110
Keep it together.

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:02.070
<i>I've never been around someone like that...!</i>

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:05.330
Can I bring you something to drink to start?

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:05.640
<i>Souma-kun's probably younger than me,</i>

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:07.020
<i>a high schooler.</i>

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.750
<i>But he's been at this job longer than me.</i>

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:13.110
<i>It might be rude for me to 
be too friendly with him.</i>

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.490
<i>How should I address him? "Souma-san"?</i>

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:21.760
<i>Speaking of, what should I call the boss?</i>

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:25.090
<i>At my last job, I just said "boss,"</i>

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:27.470
<i>but this place has a more familiar feel.</i>

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:29.130
Asami-san,

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:32.680
the table over there is having an order of 
bolognese and of cream shrimp omurice.

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:33.870
<i>"Asami-san"? That's so direct.</i>

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:35.890
<i>Should I just call her that too?</i>

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:38.920
<i>No, that's too much...</i>

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:41.910
Sis, can I have some more juice?

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.610
<i>Sis?!</i>

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:47.280
<i>Oh, wait. He actually is her little brother.</i>

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:48.220
<i>So that makes sense.</i>

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:50.000
Hayate-kun?

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.140
Yes!

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:52.530
Asa... Boss-chan!

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:55.680
<i>Now I've done it!</i>

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.560
Asa-boss-chan.

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:58.630
What language is that?

00:03:58.630 --> 00:03:59.740
It's nothing.

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:04.410
<i>Did I make him even more mad?</i>

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.480
<i>Now what?</i>

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:08.630
<i>Mima-san?</i>

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.320
<i>What is he doing here?</i>

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:11.400
<i>When did he even get here?</i>

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:12.850
<i>Wait, did he just see that?</i>

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:14.900
Hayate-kun, can I talk to you?

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:15.940
Yes.

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:17.460
What is it?

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:20.540
You've been wiping that 
table this entire time,

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:22.190
so I wondered if something's wrong.

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:24.180
I'm sorry about that.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:28.730
Could you please bring that 
table over there their change?

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:29.290
Yes.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:32.440
Mima-san.

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:35.910
I'm sorry it took me so long to say hello.

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:37.890
Here you go.

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:39.830
Thank you very much.

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:41.280
I was surprised.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:45.480
I didn't think I would 
see you again so soon.

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:47.660
I was surprised too.

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:49.170
What a coincidence!

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.390
It really is.

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:54.680
Do you come here often?

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:57.210
No, my coworker recommended it,

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:58.600
so this is my first time here.

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:01.010
I see.

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:03.310
<i>Just looking at him calms me down.</i>

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:06.400
Have you been working here for a long time?

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:08.400
No. It's my first day.

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:09.290
Your first day?

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:12.450
Well then, don't overdo it.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:13.640
But good luck.

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:17.910
<i>That's a very Mima-san thing to say.</i>

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:19.630
I'm off, then.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:20.850
Thank you very much.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:23.740
You're already leaving?

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:27.260
Yes. I've got another appointment now.

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:32.720
Also, I don't want to get 
in the way of your work.

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:35.200
This is a wonderful place.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.930
I'll be coming by again.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:39.530
Thank you so much!

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:42.100
Oh, and...

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:45.460
If there's another place where 
it's hard for me to go alone,

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:46.740
I hope I can ask you again.

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:48.950
Yes. Absolutely.

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:50.590
Goodbye.

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:53.750
Thank you very much!

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:55.700
Thank you so much!

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.590
<i>He's so cool.</i>

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:59.540
<i>And his way of inviting 
me was really chill too.</i>

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:01.410
Hey, Teach?

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:03.720
Yes, one moment.

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:06.350
<i>He forgot something!</i>

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:08.880
<i>He's cool as always,</i>

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:10.810
<i>but he's also not quite there, as always.</i>

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:12.380
Mima-san!

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:17.930
<i>He's gone.</i>

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:26.610
<b>Hedgehog Books</b>

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:25.850
<i>All I know is his work address.</i>

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:28.570
Boss.

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:31.630
The customer who just left forgot this.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:33.780
Oh, I'll hold on to it.

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:35.930
You seemed friendly.

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:37.100
Do you know him?

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:38.380
Yes. Kind of.

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:41.390
I see. That's good.

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:45.560
I saw how the tension floated 
away from you there,

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:49.770
so feel free to talk to us with 
that kind of casual attitude, too.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:51.350
All right.

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:54.430
<i>Casual...</i>

00:06:57.320 --> 00:06:58.950
<i>Yup, he's mad at me.</i>

00:06:58.950 --> 00:06:59.970
Excuse me?

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:01.220
Coming!

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:03.250
Oh.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:04.530
I'm sorry.

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:04.980
<b>Gee</b>

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:06.860
<b>Badump   Badump</b>

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:06.860
<i>Oh crap, you're keeping her waiting!</i>

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:12.170
Thank you for waiting.

00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:14.400
What is today's pasta special?

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:17.030
Today we have a mushroom cream pasta,

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:19.650
or a spinach, bacon, and tomato pasta.

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:20.840
<i>He covered for me.</i>

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:24.290
<i>He's not a scary person, after all.</i>

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:27.160
<i>First, I'll need to get to know him properly.</i>

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:30.980
Thank you so much!

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:40.210
Hey, so... thank you for earlier.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:42.340
Huh? What do you mean?

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:44.680
I dropped the menus.

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:47.550
That was, like... hours ago.

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:49.790
<i>So he </i>is<i> mad at me.</i>

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:54.880
I apologize for angering you today.

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:55.730
I'm sorry.

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:00.770
It's just that, you're too funny.

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:06.250
Just ignore him. He basically 
cracks up at anything.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.620
He does?

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:10.430
Hey, don't give me a bad name.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:09.460
<b>Wilt</b>

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:16.770
That was funny, when we failed to walk 
around each other in the beginning.

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:20.980
<i>Oh, so he was holding in his laughter.</i>

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:26.420
I was trying so hard to not 
look at you during work.

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:27.850
Because I would have remembered that.

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:30.930
<i>So it was just my misunderstanding.</i>

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:33.170
<i>Good thing I found out.</i>

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:37.980
So what were you talking about, 
when you mentioned making me mad?

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:39.540
That was nothing.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:41.400
Come on! Tell me!

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:45.210
<i>It looks like they're 
all going to get along.</i>

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:51.440
Hayate-kun!

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:53.690
Souma-kun.

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:56.820
What a coincidence.

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:58.170
Is your school around here somewhere?

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:00.480
A short train ride away.

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:03.030
<i>I guess he goes to a high 
school without uniforms...</i>

00:09:03.030 --> 00:09:05.240
It's a vocational school over in Harajuku.

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:07.200
<i>A vocational school student?</i>

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:09.320
Is something wrong?

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:11.510
Nothing at all.

00:09:11.510 --> 00:09:14.080
<i>Good thing I didn't ask him which 
high school he's going to.</i>

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:17.200
Another misunderstanding lifted

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:19.910
You're a funny guy, you know that?

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.090
Really?

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:24.730
At first glance you seem 
really intelligent and cool,

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:26.240
but you're actually quite approachable.

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:27.780
That's quite a gap.

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:29.570
The same goes for you.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:05.010
<b>Coming up next</b>

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:05.010
<b>Bento</b>

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:10.010
<b>We hope you'll tune in again!</b>

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:10.010
<b>We hope you'll tune in again!</b>
